 *          2       (     2    2)
 *                  (1 - x  - y )
 *
 *               ( 2         2)
 *          1    (x  +  (y+1) )
 * Im w  =  - log(------------)
 *          4    ( 2         2)
 *               (x  +  (y-1) )
 *
