	 * cosh(+-0 +- I Inf) = dNaN + I sign(d(+-0, dNaN))0.
	 * The sign of 0 in the result is unspecified.  Choice = normally
	 * the same as dNaN.  Raise the invalid floating-point exception.
	 *
	 * cosh(+-0 +- I NaN) = d(NaN) + I sign(d(+-0, NaN))0.
	 * The sign of 0 in the result is unspecified.  Choice = normally
	 * the same as d(NaN).
