	 * cosh(NaN + I NaN)  = d(NaN) + I d(NaN).
	 *
	 * cosh(NaN +- I Inf) = d(NaN) + I d(NaN).
	 * Optionally raises the invalid floating-point exception.
	 * Choice = raise.
